<h2>The 14 Hood Queen Bonds</h2>

<p>
The foundation of the Hood Queen movement. 
Built on values that represent strength, loyalty, and purpose.
</p>


<div class="bonds">

<div class="card"><h3>I. Loyalty</h3><p>Standing true to yourself and those who stand with you.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>II. Respect</h3><p>Giving respect and earning it through your actions.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>III. Unity</h3><p>Building together and lifting each other up.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>IV. Leadership</h3><p>Leading with confidence, purpose, and example.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>V. Protection</h3><p>Protecting your people, your values, and your vision.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>VI. Growth</h3><p>Learning, evolving, and becoming better.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>VII. Discipline</h3><p>Staying focused and committed to your goals.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>VIII. Service</h3><p>Using your success to help others rise.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>IX. Integrity</h3><p>Doing what is right even when nobody is watching.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>X. Courage</h3><p>Having the strength to face challenges.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>XI. Sisterhood</h3><p>Supporting and empowering your community.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>XII. Legacy</h3><p>Creating something that lasts beyond yourself.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>XIII. Excellence</h3><p>Always striving to become your best.</p></div>

<div class="card"><h3>XIV. Royalty</h3><p>Knowing your worth and wearing your crown.</p></div>

